<h2>Ocelli 2.1</h2>
<p class="intro">Aside Notes is now Ocelli. Same app, same license, same notes.</p>
<ul>
  <li>The app renames itself to Ocelli.app on first launch. Your notes, settings, permissions and login item stay as they are.</li>
  <li>Agents: the MCP server is now called ocelli, so its tools are mcp__ocelli__*. Claude Code and Codex registrations made by the app are moved over automatically.</li>
  <li>Thirteen app icons to pick from in Settings › App Icon.</li>
  <li>Dictation no longer goes silent after you put on AirPods or wake your Mac, and with AirPods connected it starts right away.</li>
  <li>Your own Anthropic key now runs on Claude Haiku 5.5.</li>
</ul>
